  "body": "• 3 years new, freehold & easy-care\r\n• 3 bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms\r\n• Private north-facing outdoor living\r\n• Sea views & 2 dedicating off-street car parks\r\n• Master ensuite & walk-in robe and sunny balcony\r\n• Separate custom-fitted dressing room\r\n• Pantry & breakfast bar \r\n\r\nOffering modern, low-maintenance living, this near-new freehold home at 19B Elmira Place combines practical design, sea views and a private Browns Bay setting.\r\n\r\nSet across two levels, there are three spacious bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms, including a master with ensuite and walk-in robe. Storage is a real feature, with all bedrooms benefiting from built-in bedroom storage, alongside a separate skylit dressing room that has been measured and custom-fitted as an additional walk-in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan kitchen, dining and living area features granite benchtops, a pantry and a breakfast bar. Sliding doors open to a sunny, private north-facing entertaining area, complemented by an irrigation system for easy garden maintenance. The guest bathroom downstairs also incorporates a cleverly tucked-away laundry with a combined washer/dryer.\r\n\r\nDouble glazing, dual heat pumps and two dedicated off-street car parks add to the practicality, with no Body Corporate or Residential Association fees to pay.\r\n\r\nTucked away in a private cul-de-sac, while still approximately six minutes from Browns Bay Village, Westfield Albany and Albany Bus Station, with sought-after school zones also close by.\r\n\r\nCall us today to arrange your private viewing, or we look forward to welcoming you at our open homes.",
